zohobooks.svg and zohoinventory.svg are the product marks from
https://github.com/ComposioHQ/open-logos (zoho-books.svg and
zoho-inventory.svg). The logo-cdn files for those two slugs are the
same Zoho square.

carta.svg is the Carta wordmark from Wikimedia Commons
(File:Carta-logo.svg), with a white plate behind it.
gupshup.svg and ironclad.svg are the symbol cropped from each vendor's
published logo SVG. impact.svg traces the three-dot mark on impact.com's
published logo. shiprocket.png is the Shiprocket site icon.
Brand names and marks remain the property of their owners.
